      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `diarized_transcript.py` that requests speaker diarization for a recorded meeting, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. I will use the Google Cloud Speech-to-Text API for this task, as it provides speaker diarization features. The integration will be identifiable by the import of the `google.cloud.speech` module and the use of the `SpeechClient` class from this module. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789849271449,
          "start": 1789849267846
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bb546e86001d25SODS60UE8Uz",
