      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the `poll_transcription.py` file that polls a transcription job and returns the transcript, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider. I will use the Amazon Transcribe service for this task, as it is a well-known and widely used service for transcription. The code will include the necessary imports and authentication to identify the provider. </thinking>\n",
